    "reviewer": "codex-primary-controller",
    "classification": "CPC3 October workbook row 1901, HS 3915.10 and chapter 39 notes 6–7 support the pre-consumer strip/bale state. Cast film and its offcuts share a production process. Conforming film (36330), polymers in primary forms and downstream recycling have distinct functions. No competing accepted edge for this identity, including the existing method for new blown film.",
    "primary_evidence": "LyondellBasell demonstrates cast-film edge-trim generation, but its in-line recycling example cannot prove external sale. Greenview lists edge trim separately from startup and reel rejects. 3G distinguishes purchased industrial scrap from toll conversion. Recovering Polymers also buys multilayer grades. ReMA post-use grades cannot establish this pre-use source or its contamination thresholds. No typical yield, price, credit, quantity or matched commercial lot is inferred.",
    "measurement": "Q is net first-quality-released trim including newly released closing stock. WIP carries exchange-specific burdens. Returns and subsequent services keep original cohort, denominator and separately reported increments. Gross dispatch and dry or polymer-only content are distinct. Subdivide exclusive winding, collection and baling. Apply demonstrated physical causality per remaining exchange, then economic allocation only for a genuinely residual joint burden on consistent source-gate values. A negative-price or no-value stream requires independent justification of the allocation and waste-treatment scenario. Check actual utilities, cooling makeup, component stocks and receiver terms.",
    "native_records": "Nineteen distinct canonical identities were independently verified in thirteen archived originals and six version-pinned live originals. The Chinese grid consumption-mix power flow uses Net calorific value in MJ even though electrical energy is measured in kWh. Match geography and voltage. Conditional input identities include grade-specific galvanised wire, a paper core for winding, and treated tap water. An actual release to air is required for unspecified particulate matter. Neither broad raw polyethylene nor the collected PE-film/HDPE-container Waste interface identifies the first-release Product.",
    "readiness": "English and Chinese each have 34 inventory rows. Fifteen explicitly unresolved row identities include the reference Product and internal transfers. Independent pcr:check performed 173 checks with zero skipped and 27 warnings. Candidate/authored, Chinese aligned. Scientific and formal translation review, actual commercial lot evidence and suitable providers remain outstanding.",
